{"seq":4,"slug":"ios-architecture","title":"iOS 架构与模块化","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture","rating":{"composite":4.49,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.87,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# iOS 架构与模块化 简介\n\niOS 应用的架构质量决定了项目的长期生命力。当应用从一个简单的单页面原型演变为拥有数十个功能模块、多个团队并行开发的大型产品时，架构设计的好坏将直接体现在开发效率、代码可维护性和发布稳定性上。MVC 能否支撑复杂业务？模块化拆分到什么粒度才合理？依赖注入如何让测试不再痛苦？导航逻辑该由谁来管控？这些问题没有唯一正确答案，但存在经过大规模实践验证的成熟方案。本手册系统梳理 iOS 架构与模块化的核心知识体系，帮助你在面对任何规模的 iOS 项目时，都能做出合理的架构决策。\n\n本手册适合已经具备 iOS 开发基础、能够独立完成中等复杂度应用的工程师。如果你正在经历\"Massive View Controller\"的困扰、模块间耦合严重难以独立编译、导航逻辑散落在各处难以维护等典型架构痛点，这里将为你提供从理论到落地的完整解决路径。\n\n第一章**架构模式**系统对比 iOS 开发中主流的架构范式。从经典的 MVC 到响应式的 MVVM，从函数式驱动的 TCA 可组合架构到层次分明的整洁架构和 VIPER——每种模式都有其设计哲学和最佳适用场景，理解它们的本质差异是架构选型的前提。\n\n第二章**模块化设计**深入探讨大型 iOS 应用的模块拆分策略。模块边界的划分原则、Swift Package Manager 的模块化实践、二进制框架的分发与集成、接口模块模式对依赖方向的控制——模块化不是简单的代码搬运，而是一套关于职责分离、编译隔离和团队协作的系统工程。\n\n第三章**依赖注入**从原理到实践构建灵活的依赖管理体系。依赖注入的基础概念与价值、容器模式的注册与解析机制、Swift 属性包装器带来的声明式注入体验，以及如何借助依赖注入让单元测试真正可行——依赖注入是连接架构设计与可测试性的关键桥梁。\n\n第四章**导航架构**解决 iOS 应用中最容易失控的导航逻辑。Coordinator 模式如何将导航职责从视图控制器中抽离、深度链接路由的统一处理机制、模块化应用中跨模块导航的协调策略，以及 SwiftUI 时代导航架构的全新范式——良好的导航架构让应用的页面流转清晰可控、易于扩展。\n\n第五章**大规模实践**聚焦于超大型 iOS 项目的工程化挑战。构建时间的度量与优化手段、代码生成在消除样板代码中的应用、功能开关对渐进式发布的支撑，以及发布工程的自动化流程——这些实践是支撑数百万行代码级别项目高效运转的基础设施。\n\n第六章**测试架构**从架构视角重新审视 iOS 应用的测试策略。如何设计天然可测试的架构、快照测试对 UI 一致性的守护、集成测试对模块间协作的验证，以及 iOS 持续集成环境的搭建与优化——测试不是开发完成后的附加项，而是架构设计的一等公民。\n\n推荐的学习路径是先从架构模式建立全局认知，理解不同模式的核心思想和取舍，再深入模块化设计和依赖注入掌握大型应用的组织方法论，然后结合导航架构解决实际项目中的页面流转问题，最后通过大规模实践和测试架构完善工程化能力。iOS 架构能力的提升是一个渐进过程，但每一步深入都会让你在面对复杂项目时更加从容。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-patterns","title":"架构模式","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mvc-to-mvvm","title":"从 MVC 到 MVVM","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/mvc-to-mvvm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tca-composable-architecture","title":"TCA 可组合架构","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/tca-composable-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"clean-architecture","title":"整洁架构","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/clean-architecture"},{"seq":4,"slug":"viper","title":"VIPER 架构","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/architecture-patterns/viper"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"modular-design","title":"模块化设计","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-boundaries","title":"模块边界","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/module-boundaries"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spm-modularization","title":"SPM 模块化","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/spm-modularization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"binary-frameworks","title":"二进制框架","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/binary-frameworks"},{"seq":4,"slug":"interface-module-pattern","title":"接口模块模式","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/modular-design/interface-module-pattern"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-injection","title":"依赖注入","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"di-fundamentals","title":"依赖注入基础","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/di-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"container-patterns","title":"容器模式","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/container-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"property-wrapper-injection","title":"属性包装器注入","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/property-wrapper-injection"},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-with-di","title":"基于 DI 的测试","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/testing-with-di"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"navigation-architecture","title":"导航架构","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"coordinator-pattern","title":"Coordinator 模式","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/coordinator-pattern"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deeplink-routing","title":"深度链接路由","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/deeplink-routing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation-in-modular-apps","title":"模块化应用中的导航","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/navigation-in-modular-apps"},{"seq":4,"slug":"swiftui-navigation-architecture","title":"SwiftUI 导航架构","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/swiftui-navigation-architecture"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"large-scale-practices","title":"大规模实践","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"build-time-optimization","title":"构建时间优化","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/build-time-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/code-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-flags","title":"功能开关","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/feature-flags"},{"seq":4,"slug":"release-engineering","title":"发布工程","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/large-scale-practices/release-engineering"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"testing-architecture","title":"测试架构","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testable-architecture","title":"可测试架构","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/testable-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-testing","title":"快照测试","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/snapshot-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration-testing","title":"集成测试","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/integration-testing"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ci-for-ios","title":"iOS 持续集成","url":"/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/ci-for-ios"}]}]}